    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "2. Heard the learned counsel for the applicant and the learned APP for the respondent/State.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 867,
      "end": 959,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "3. The learned counsel for the applicant has vehemently argued that the applicant had been falsely implicated by the co-accused Shubham Pawar.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 960,
      "end": 1103,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Shubham Pawar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1089,
          "end": 1102
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1945926696062088
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "As per the isntructions of the applicant, Shubham Pawar was about to sell the alleged Gutka.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1104,
      "end": 1196,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Shubham Pawar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1146,
          "end": 1159
        },
        {
          "text": "Gutka",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1190,
          "end": 1195
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2576048672199249
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "The applicant has no ABA712.22 concern with Shubham.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1197,
      "end": 1249,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Shubham",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1241,
          "end": 1248
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27858683466911316
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "He has falsely named the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1250,
      "end": 1286,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3846074342727661
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Therefore, the applicant may be released on anticipatory bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1287,
      "end": 1349,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.293536901473999
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "4. Per contra, the learned APP would submit that there are two antecedents to the discredit of the applicant of the similar offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1350,
      "end": 1483,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2579539120197296
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The co-accused Shubham has immediately after apprehension disclosed that the applicant had supplied the contraband/Gutka to him.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1484,
      "end": 1612,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Shubham",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1499,
          "end": 1506
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32094666361808777
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The applicant is the stockist of Gutka.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1613,
      "end": 1652,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Gutka",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1646,
          "end": 1651
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4395213723182678
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The police wanted to know where from the present applicant purchased the prohibited Gutka.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1653,
      "end": 1743,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Gutka",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1737,
          "end": 1742
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3412066698074341
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Therefore, custodial interrogation is essential.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1744,
      "end": 1792,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4994105398654938
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "5. Perused the application and the papers.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1794,
      "end": 1836,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3932340741157532
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "There appears substance in the arguments of the learned APP.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1837,
      "end": 1897,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11915173381567001
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The applicant is seen repeatedly involved in the similar offence.",
